---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Qognito.io | Certifying Agentic AI Training & Architectures" lang="en">
  <!-- Hero Section : Strategic Panorama (2026 AI Paradigm Shift) -->
  <section id="accueil" class="hero-section" style="padding-top: 50px; padding-bottom: 70px;">
    <div class="container hero-container">
      <!-- Main Brand Title with H1 font size -->
      <h1 class="hero-title text-glow" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
        The Agentic Engineering Academy<span class="logo-dot">.</span>
      </h1>

      <span class="monospace-label" style="display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 16px;">STRATEGIC PANORAMA & 2026 AI SHIFT</span>
      
      <div style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 35px; line-height: 1.35; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
        The Era of Profitability & Agentic Engineering<span style="color: #D4850F;">.</span>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Stage 1: Global Market Panorama (Multi-Target) -->
      <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0A1628 0%, #0F2238 100%); border: 1px solid #1E293B; border-left: 4px solid #38bdf8; padding: 32px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 35px;">
        <h2 style="color: #38bdf8; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 600;">
          Global Panorama: The New Industrial Order of AI
        </h2>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 24px;">
          The AI market has moved beyond fleeting demo chatbots into an era of <strong>pragmatic industrialization focused on profitability and real business results</strong>. This shift brutally redefines engineering requirements and skill sets:
        </p>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px;">
          <div style="background-color: #0A1628; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #334155;">
            <strong style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 0.92rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">Collapse of Raw Code & Prompting</strong>
            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
              Basic syntax execution and superficial prompting are commoditized. High-value engineering has shifted to multi-agent fleet architecture, REST plumbing, and deterministic control.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="background-color: #0A1628; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #334155;">
            <strong style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 0.92rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">Cost per Task Arbitrage (C<sub>task</sub>)</strong>
            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
              CIOs and CFOs demand financial proof of ROI. Every production agent must justify its full cost per successful task against equivalent human expertise.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="background-color: #0A1628; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #334155;">
            <strong style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 0.92rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">Broken Junior Pipeline & "2nd Step"</strong>
            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
              The freeze on entry-level jobs (-66% junior offers) creates a major learning deficit. The market demands profiles capable of designing, supervising, and auditing autonomous systems.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="background-color: #0A1628; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #334155;">
            <strong style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 0.92rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">Security Harnesses & AI Act Compliance</strong>
            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
              Against agentic escape risks, mastering evaluation benchmarks (<em>Evals</em>), isolated sandboxes, and regulatory compliance (EU AI Act) has become a prerequisite.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 2: Higher Education Target Alignment -->
      <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0A1628 0%, #17253D 100%); border: 1px solid #D4850F; border-left: 4px solid #D4850F; padding: 32px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 35px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <h2 style="color: #D4850F; font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 600;">
          Academic Pivot: Higher Education & Graduate Schools
        </h2>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 24px;">
          Facing this structural shift in junior employment, Engineering & Business Schools and Universities must urgently realign their curricula (CTI / CGE standards) to secure graduate employability:
        </p>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          <div style="background-color: #0A1628; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #334155;">
            <strong style="color: #D4850F; font-size: 0.92rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">1. Training "Agent Architects"</strong>
            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
              Pivot from basic coding towards Spec-Driven Development, REST/JSON Schema plumbing, object-oriented resilience (R/Python OOP), and agent governance.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="background-color: #0A1628; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #334155;">
            <strong style="color: #D4850F; font-size: 0.92rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">2. Providing "Second Step" Pedagogy</strong>
            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
              Compensate for the closure of traditional entry-level internships by integrating agentic enterprise simulators and high-intensity hands-on labs.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="background-color: #0A1628; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #334155;">
            <strong style="color: #D4850F; font-size: 0.92rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">3. Integrating Audit & EU AI Act Compliance</strong>
            <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0;">
              Equip students with evaluation skills (<em>Evals</em>), observability, and neutral auditing, opening a high-value, non-substitutable career track.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Strategic Placement for Primary CTA Button pointing to /en/formations -->
        <div style="text-align: center; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #334155;">
          <a href="/en/formations" class="btn-primary" style="font-size: 1.02rem; padding: 16px 32px; box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(212, 133, 15, 0.35);">
            Discover the Qognito Triad Programs →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Banner Section to Expertise / Case Studies -->
  <section class="section" style="background-color: #0d1B2A; padding: 80px 0; margin-top: 60px; border-top: 1px solid #1E293B;">
    <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
      <span class="monospace-label" style="display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 10px;">BACKGROUND & PROOF</span>
      <h2 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.7rem; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Looking for our Studies & Case Studies?</h2>
      <p style="color: #cbd5e1; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 30px auto; font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.6;">
        Explore the page dedicated to our historical expertise, the 7-Section Feasibility Study methodology, and our results in critical industry.
      </p>
      <a href="/en/expertise" class="btn-secondary" style="padding: 14px 28px; font-size: 0.95rem;">View Expertise & Case Studies →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
